            "title": "About Us",
            "inNavigation": true,
            "excerpt": "Learn more about Aura Resonance.",
            "content": "<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>NRUL</strong> is a two-member music group driven by exploration, vision, and relevance while staying grounded in authenticity. Our sound is shaped by diverse influences, blending elements of Japanese music, lo-fi pop, R&amp;B, and hip-hop into a style that feels both personal and evolving. Through every project, we aim to create music that resonates with the present while remaining true to who we are.</p><p><strong>Contact</strong></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Email: waone2094@gmail.com</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Instagram: <a href=\"https://instagram.com/nrulmusic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">instagram.com/nrulmusic</a></li></ol><p><br></p>",
